{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777878417390","title":"Agentic privacy lebih baik dengan typed indexed placeholders daripada fake identities","desc":"Dalam multi-turn agent, indexed placeholders menjaga referential consistency tanpa menambahkan fakta palsu ke context.","tags":["zettel","privacy","pii","agent","masking"],"created":1777878443788,"updated":1777948651923,"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"4d35603d1bc5d560c8c1d65a530db648","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.privacy","alias":"privacy","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.privacy"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.pii","alias":"pii","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.pii"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agent","alias":"agent","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agent"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.masking","alias":"masking","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.masking"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp.indexed-masking","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":830},"end":{"line":18,"column":65,"offset":892},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp.indexed-masking"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":3,"offset":895},"end":{"line":19,"column":49,"offset":941},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777878417390","id":"zettel.1777878417390","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":3,"offset":944},"end":{"line":20,"column":44,"offset":985},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture"}}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"agentic-privacy-lebih-baik-dengan-typed-indexed-placeholders-daripada-fake-identities\">Agentic privacy lebih baik dengan typed indexed placeholders daripada fake identities<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#agentic-privacy-lebih-baik-dengan-typed-indexed-placeholders-daripada-fake-identities\"></a></h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Untuk agentic multi-turn conversation, lebih aman menyamarkan PII dengan token terindeks daripada menggantinya dengan nilai palsu yang bisa mengubah konteks.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Catatan gue:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fake pseudonymization bisa membuat model reasoning berdasarkan dunia palsu, bukan dunia pengguna.</li>\n<li>Indexed placeholders seperti <code>[PERSON_001]</code>, <code>[ORG_001]</code>, <code>[LOCATION_001]</code> menjaga struktur referensi tanpa menambahkan asumsi semantik.</li>\n<li>Mapping asli disimpan lokal, sehingga de-masking bisa dilakukan dengan kontrol.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Implikasi:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Privacy layer harus memisahkan identity value dari task-relevant structure.</li>\n<li>Untuk entity yang punya makna task (lokasi, salary, medical condition), placeholder harus dilengkapi metadata abstraction, bukan hanya token polos.</li>\n<li>Ini membuat privacy protection lebih deterministik dan lebih mudah diaudit.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hubungan:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp.indexed-masking\">Indexed masking untuk agentic PII protection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.camp\">CAMP: Cross-Turn PII Protection for LLM Conversations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">privacy (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">pii (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agent (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">masking (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","add